      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
      <p>Got something you want to talk about? Share your thoughts with us through <a href="/feedbackus">FeedbackUs</a>.</p>
      <div class="allTheRules">
        <!-- generator - for each   -->
        <!-- template with title and content  -->
        <div class="category">
          <div class="stretch_title">
            <h2>Feedback us</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="condition_title">
              <h3>Feature Ideas</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="condition_content">
              <p>Through <a href="/feedbackus">FeedbackUs</a> you can share ideas of what you think it would enrich everyone’s experience on BoardGameHive.ro.</p>
              <p>Keep in mind that you should only do this of your free will and if you are willing to not own any legal rights, because it’s not an exchange, transaction, or rent of the intellectual rights, but only a free advice to give us a suggestion of what you think it might improve the users experience and yours. </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <div class="condition_title">
              <h3>Replace a design with</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="condition_content">
              <p>Through <a href="/feedbackus">FeedbackUs</a> you can share what you think that it doesn’t look or feel right of how has been something built, design or implemented.</p>
              <p>Keep in mind that you should only do this of your own free will and if you are willing to not own any legal rights, because it’s not an exchange, transaction, or rent of the intellectual rights, but only a free advice to give us a suggestion of what you think it might improve the users experience and yours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="condition_title">
              <h3>It doesn't work</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="condition_content">
              <p>Through <a href="/feedbackus">FeedbackUs</a> you can report if something doesn’t works as it was intended to, and we will try to fix it.</p>
              <p>Keep in mind that you should only do this of your own free will and if you are willing to not own any legal rights, because it’s not an exchange, transaction, or rent of the intellectual rights, but only a free advice to give us a suggestion of what you think it might improve the users experience and yours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="condition_title">
              <h3>Something else</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="condition_content">
              <p>Through <a href="/feedbackus">FeedbackUs</a> you can share anything else that doesn’t fit in the other categories, including ill behavior of a player. </p>
              <p>Sharing about the ill behavior of a player, could result in various actions from our side to resolve the report.
                Depending on the time line order and total number of feedbacks from all the players, we cannot quantify when this will be resolved, but nevertheless we will do our best to complete it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>



        <div class="category">
